        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a3dbd4ed-1f8a-3bae-b9b0-93a39b251392",
                "word": "adulation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ce3dd758-3007-4932-a861-17858f0f443c",
                        "entry_id": "a3dbd4ed-1f8a-3bae-b9b0-93a39b251392",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "adulations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e57ed175-c8a6-3da5-b59b-68f899452765",
                        "entry_id": "a3dbd4ed-1f8a-3bae-b9b0-93a39b251392",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action d’aduler."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f488fcaa-12e2-4424-ba45-489b2bd1d10b",
                                "sense_id": "e57ed175-c8a6-3da5-b59b-68f899452765",
                                "text": "Je ne regimbai point contre des adulations qui ne pouvaient plus en aucun cas me faire changer d’avis ; je les accueillis comme la naïve expression du médiocre avait rendu le goût indulgent et émoussé le sens acéré des choses supérieures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df6e50c9-9906-411f-83b6-9387aff2e297",
                                "sense_id": "e57ed175-c8a6-3da5-b59b-68f899452765",
                                "text": "Sous les gouvernements autoritaires, comme le premier Empire, l'Etat s’en est servi pour contraindre le clergé catholique à la soumission la plus humiliante, aux adulations les plus basses, même à un rôle répugnant de policier, en usant contre les ministres des cultes récalcitrants de moyens coercitifs violents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e6f066c-682f-4128-907f-f318cc4ea03b",
                                "sense_id": "e57ed175-c8a6-3da5-b59b-68f899452765",
                                "text": "L’adulation atteignait un tel niveau que la moindre critique émise par des journalistes ou commentateurs politiques était vivement vilipendée."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "614220fd-4f9e-4f9b-b532-c56297358060",
                        "source_entry_id": "a3dbd4ed-1f8a-3bae-b9b0-93a39b251392",
                        "source_sense_id": "e57ed175-c8a6-3da5-b59b-68f899452765",
                        "target_lang_word": "Lobhudelei",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Lobhudelei",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                        "entry_id": "0e7426de-d4bd-3af5-961c-820bf01577ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "überschwängliches Lob in unangemessener oder übertriebener Weise (meist um sich einzuschmeicheln)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c302084b-1310-4332-84b0-f6a1e273a505",
                                                "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                                "text": "Ich wunderte mich über die ganze Lobhudelei in Zeitung und Fernsehen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "055937f4-f249-4c69-94a8-413fc9c152b1",
                                                "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                                "text": "Bei seiner Verabschiedung vom öffentlichen Amt gab es die übliche Lobhudelei."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91386eb1-6d63-4e7f-b6e6-23ec192f6f38",
                                                "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                                "text": "Eine Lobhudelei kann ganz schön schmeicheln."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa27878b-a545-4cd9-b9b2-9f46ddac2210",
                                                "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                                "text": "[Dem Kosmonauten Siegmund Jähn] selbst war die Lobhudelei eher zuwider, er blieb bescheiden und bodenständig."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de24a89a-f01e-46f5-ba88-ea5c67545cf8",
                                                "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                                "text": "„[Die Medien ud der Hof] haben ihm wirklich immer nur Lobhudeleien ins Ohr geflüstert, so dass der Schah irgendwann von seiner eigenen Größe derart überzeugt war, dass er die tatsächlichen Verhältnisse vollkommen verkannt hat.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0593819d-85d2-4c50-be0d-dbb16642003c",
                                                "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                                "text": "„Überschwänglich - und vielleicht ein wenig zu heftig - klopft der gemütliche Inder dabei seinem ivorischen Kollegen auf Schulter. Dem ist die ganze Lobhudelei offensichtlich ein wenig unangenehm.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51b23d06-2e53-40cc-9c3c-3cbe1f2d944c",
                                                "sense_id": "5304ee90-05fa-3934-a868-42dbebe323a9",
                                                "text": "[Im US-Fernsehen] hält Demi Moore eine Rede über ihren Ex-Mann [Bruce Willis]. Von Laudatio oder Lobhudelei keine Spur."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4ef4edc-0482-4979-8ea1-8a08ac9a918a",
                        "source_entry_id": "a3dbd4ed-1f8a-3bae-b9b0-93a39b251392",
                        "source_sense_id": "e57ed175-c8a6-3da5-b59b-68f899452765",
                        "target_lang_word": "adulation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adulation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5d2f6c0-19aa-3491-8b9b-ce5d78e07aef",
                                        "entry_id": "4d4870b1-52ac-3e4e-806f-e1d69e3b3315",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Flattery; fulsome praise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5576cd19-48b4-41c9-9dc8-2cb2caf4f9a5",
                                                "sense_id": "a5d2f6c0-19aa-3491-8b9b-ce5d78e07aef",
                                                "text": "He was uncomfortable with the adulation from his fans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4380e83d-b10b-4150-abad-2d7a47de9f1c",
                                                "sense_id": "a5d2f6c0-19aa-3491-8b9b-ce5d78e07aef",
                                                "text": "Now all this was very fine, but not at all in keeping with the Celebrity's character as I had come to conceive it. The idea that adulation ever cloyed on him was ludicrous in itself. In fact I thought the whole story fishy, and came very near to saying so."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3d6d7f3-dbae-4363-84f4-567ef82dd87d",
                                                "sense_id": "a5d2f6c0-19aa-3491-8b9b-ce5d78e07aef",
                                                "text": "It is still possible to discuss his place in art, and the adulation of his admirers is perhaps no less capricious than the disparagement of his detractors; [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fac074c-2763-4e14-8bf2-d86d0dfc00c6",
                                                "sense_id": "a5d2f6c0-19aa-3491-8b9b-ce5d78e07aef",
                                                "text": "To law enforcement officers injured in the Jan. 6 mayhem, as well as members of Congress and others present in the Capitol that day who feared for their lives, such adulation for convicted rioters is not only misguided but also anathema to a civilized society."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9580123f-e8e6-4a0b-889a-50e848d5472e",
                        "source_entry_id": "a3dbd4ed-1f8a-3bae-b9b0-93a39b251392",
                        "source_sense_id": "e57ed175-c8a6-3da5-b59b-68f899452765",
                        "target_lang_word": "flattery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flattery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04c62ca2-d196-3249-a5ae-3c3447923f27",
                                        "entry_id": "c93c72a2-d0c5-30f3-be86-06d0653e1695",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excessive praise or approval, which is often insincere and sometimes contrived to win favour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a8d1bc1-5cc1-41da-b2ec-d297228e1676",
                                                "sense_id": "04c62ca2-d196-3249-a5ae-3c3447923f27",
                                                "text": "Don't you know that some of his contributions here are pure flattery?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84e28d5a-21b2-41f9-8bff-62436510b88b",
                                                "sense_id": "04c62ca2-d196-3249-a5ae-3c3447923f27",
                                                "text": "That the young Mr. Churchills liked—but they did not like him coming round of an evening and drinking weak whisky-and-water while he held forth on railway debentures and corporation loans. Mr. Barrett, however, by fawning and flattery, seemed to be able to make not only Mrs. Churchill but everyone else do what he desired."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5d3e345-0dfa-343c-b973-8fbc2e092440",
                                        "entry_id": "c93c72a2-d0c5-30f3-be86-06d0653e1695",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of excessive praise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17822322-58a9-49da-8d1a-5e2a10403806",
                                                "sense_id": "c5d3e345-0dfa-343c-b973-8fbc2e092440",
                                                "text": "But I pitty the flatteries, and ſelfe-applauſes of a careleſſe and impenitent heart: This jollity hath in it much danger, and vvithout ſome change, death."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4861ef2b-cdef-405c-82ba-a6c60e8a943d",
                        "source_entry_id": "a3dbd4ed-1f8a-3bae-b9b0-93a39b251392",
